1
00:00:00,295 --> 00:00:02,125
(Raj:)Go ahead, make fun.

2
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:03,230
(Raj:)You can't embarrass me.

3
00:00:03,231 --> 00:00:04,601
(Raj:)I've got a beautiful
girlfriend

4
00:00:04,599 --> 00:00:07,299
(Raj:)and a dog who loves me so much
she drinks my bathwater.

5
00:00:09,737 --> 00:00:13,137
(Howard:)Okay, who was he talking to,
Emily or Cinnamon:

6
00:00:13,141 --> 00:00:15,741
"I want you to know,
the bed feels so lonely

7
00:00:15,743 --> 00:00:17,473
when you're not in it."

8
00:00:23,985 --> 00:00:26,055
(Raj:)I may not be liking
this game so much.

9
00:00:27,588 --> 00:00:29,158
(Howard:)Cinnamon.
Give me another one.

10
00:00:30,091 --> 00:00:31,661
Okay, Emily or Cinnamon:

11
00:00:31,659 --> 00:00:33,589
"Check it out,
I got us matching sweaters!"

12
00:00:33,594 --> 00:00:36,024
(Leonard:)We all got the Christmas card--
Cinnamon.

13
00:00:37,598 --> 00:00:40,998
(Raj:)You know, a man can care deeply
about a woman and a pet.

14
00:00:41,002 --> 00:00:42,002
(Raj:)It's not strange.

15
00:00:42,003 --> 00:00:43,003
(Leonard:)Ooh, Emily.

16
00:00:43,004 --> 00:00:45,074
(Leonard:)I heard him say that
to Emily.

17
00:00:46,274 --> 00:00:48,444
(Leonard:)Hey, I thought
you were staying home.

18
00:00:48,443 --> 00:00:50,613
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I was, but after
talking to Penny,

19
00:00:50,611 --> 00:00:52,441
I realized something.

20
00:00:52,447 --> 00:00:55,617
(Sheldon:)I... first, she's trying much
harder to stay attractive

